Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B token embeddings
====================================

The token vocabulary (code_tokens.h / code_tokens.txt) and the int8-quantized
token vector blob (code_vectors.bin, embedded via code_vectors_blob.S) in this
directory are derived from the Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B embedding model:

  Model:     Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B
  Source:    https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B
  Revision:  97b0c614be4d77ee51c0cef4e5f07c00f9eb65b3
  Publisher: Qwen team, Alibaba Group — https://huggingface.co/Qwen
  License:   Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory)

Where the licence text came from
--------------------------------
The upstream model repository ships NO LICENSE or NOTICE file — its file list
is .gitattributes, README.md, config.json, tokenizer_config.json and
model.safetensors. The licence is declared as `license: apache-2.0` in the
model card's YAML front matter and in the Hugging Face model metadata, and the
model card body states "The model is released under the Apache 2.0 license".

The LICENSE text in this directory is therefore the canonical Apache License
2.0 from https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.txt, which is the same
source scripts/audit-license-provenance.py already checks vendored/nomic
against. It is byte-identical to vendored/nomic/LICENSE
(sha256 cfc7749b96f63bd31c3c42b5c471bf756814053e847c10f3eb003417bc523d30) —
both models are Apache-2.0, so the licence file does not change across the
swap. What changes is this NOTICE.

Derivation
----------
Per-token static embeddings are produced by running full inference of the
upstream model over a filtered token vocabulary, Matryoshka-truncated from the
model's native 1024 dimensions to 768, followed by int8 unit-vector
quantization. See scripts/extract_nomic_vectors.py for the exact extraction
procedure and docs/EMBEDDING-SWAP.md for the swap. No other part of the model
is redistributed.

  Tokens:     40928
  Dimensions: 768 (Matryoshka truncation of the model's 1024)
  Pooling:    last-token, left padding, no instruction prefix (document side),
              float32 inference — the settings the upstream model repo
              specifies; see MODEL_PROFILES["qwen3"] in the extraction script

STATUS
------
The vectors are IN this directory: code_vectors.bin, code_tokens.txt,
code_tokens.h, code_vectors.h and code_vectors_blob.S were extracted from the
revision pinned above. They are not yet wired into the build — Makefile.hyp and
src/semantic/semantic.c still reference vendored/nomic/ — so both directories
are present and both attributions are required.

vendored/nomic/ is upstream codebase-memory-mcp's directory, not ours, and is
never edited in place. vendored/nomic/LICENSE and vendored/nomic/NOTICE stay
exactly as they are until nomic's vectors are actually deleted from the tree.

